\[Theta] and p are not independent: you cannot mix them a write formulas 
partly with \[Theta] and partly with p and then solve by p.....
\
\>", "Text",
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.3686274509803922, 0.7098039215686275, 0.9333333333333333],
 CellTags->{
